{% for entry in tree %}

## {{ entry.version }}{% if entry.date %} ({{ entry.date }}){% endif %}

{% if entry.version == "v0.1.0" %}
### Release status

v0.1.0 is the first rung of `docs/roadmap.md`: `core/` (MIT OR GPL-2.0-only, with `core/LICENSE`), installable as the CMake package `posant-core` on swarm-core's vcpkg port, and `docs/` (the fidelity sheet and its references), as they stand on `main` at the release commit. It has **not** cleared the three gates of org golden rule 6 (a fidelity sheet from its source, the per-PR delivery smoke, and an anchor reproducing the source's own trend), and there is no ns-3 module yet. No result from this release counts as a benchmark number.

{% endif %}
